ished casing, lacks a visible white border, or lacks contrast that makes the white border visible.\\\"\n\\\"\"'$S/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --step-section \"$P\" 01-button-chain-implementation/05-step-behavior-test handoff '\"\\\\\n  -p 7.1: \\\"W06 may start after node button-chain.behavior.test.mjs passes and its output is recorded by the executor.\\\"\n\\\"\"'$S/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --goal-section \"$P\" 02-browser-story-validation dependencies-and-handoffs '\"\\\\\n  -p 7.1: \\\"Depends on W05 from Goal 01. If US-01 fails, execution must mark US-01 bug found, retain reproduction evidence, add new investigation, fix, and retest work units/goals, update plan-description.md, work-unit-inventory.md, progress trackers, ui-user-stories.md, ui-story-runs/US-01.md, bugs.md, testing companions, and rerun the validator before executing the new scope.\\\" \\\\\n  -p 7.2: \\\"If a severe blocker prevents reliable story execution, pause lower-priority work, complete the investigation/fix path first, rerun validation, then restart browser story testing from US-01.\\\" \\\\\n  -p 7.3: \\\"Completion handoff: US-01 has browser evidence showing finished with a visible white border against a contrasting state, and bugs.md has no unresolved bug rows.\\\"\n\\\"\"'$S/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --step-section \"$P\" 02-browser-story-validation/01-step-browser-story-us-01 instructions '\"\\\\\n  -p 5.1: \\\"After implementation only, open the local button-chain.html in a browser and execute ui-story-runs/US-01.md exactly through visible mouse clicks or taps.\\\" \\\\\n  -p 5.2: \\\"Record the route or file URL, observed button counts after each append click, final finished text, visible white border contrast evidence, and any console or rendering errors relevant to a failure.\\\" \\\\\n  -p 5.3: \\\"If any expected result fails, mark US-01 as bug found and populate bugs.md with reproduction/evidence, severity, investigation goal, fix goal, retest story, and status before adding the new durable plan work units.\\\" \\\\\n  -p 5.4: \\\"The bug loop must update plan-description.md, work-unit-inventory.md, progress trackers, ui-user-stories.md, ui-story-runs/US-01.md, bugs.md, testing companions, and rerun validation before execution continues; severe blockers restart testing from US-01 after the fix.\\\"\n\\\"\"'$S/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --step-section \"$P\" 02-browser-story-validation/01-step-browser-story-us-01 acceptance-criteria '\"\\\\\n  -p 6.1: \\\"US-01 is marked passed only after direct browser clicks produce the final finished state with a visible white border against a contrasting state.\\\" \\\\\n  -p 6.2: \\\"bugs.md has no unresolved rows at completion, and the story cache contains actual evidence rather than planned-only placeholders.\\\" \\\\\n  -p 6.3: \\\"Any severe blocker discovered during story execution has completed investigation/fix/retest work units and a restarted US-01 run before final approval.\\\"\n\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
